#

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Demo assets that are NOT redistributable from this repository.
#
# The sandbox loads its demo content from sandbox/public/shado/. Two corpora
# there cannot be published: EverQuest-derived geometry (Daybreak's art) and a
# 125 MB Ryzom source corpus that is too large to be worth carrying. Both are
# generated locally by the private content pipeline, so they are absent from a
# fresh clone rather than missing from it.
#
# Routes that need them therefore do not run from a public clone:
#   /            and /msdf          -> shado/eq-demo
#   /world       and /world-editor  -> shado/worlds
#   /test                           -> shado/preprocessed
#   /ryzom, /ryzom-actors           -> shado/ryzom (already dev-only)
#
# What IS published: shado/hum, shado/huf and shado/supermesh, all derived from
# Ryzom's CC-BY-SA assets - see NOTICE.md. Those drive /hum-wardrobe and
# /supermesh-scale, which are the routes the library is actually demonstrated by.
sandbox/public/shado/eq-demo/
sandbox/public/shado/worlds/
sandbox/public/shado/preprocessed/
sandbox/public/shado/ryzom/

# Local benchmark captures
sandbox/benchmark-results/
